# NAME: ParsecP2P-Port9000 (optional)
# AUTHOR: Horatio Xu
# FORMAT: Loon remote .lsr (policy-less)
# RULES: 1
# OFFICIAL-REVIEW: 2026-11-13
# USE: Explicit opt-in only; assign DIRECT. Requires Loon 3.1.7+.
# Requires Parsec Client Port 9000. Also matches unrelated UDP using source port 9000.
# SOURCE: https://nsloon.app/docs/Rule/logic_rule/
# SOURCE: https://nsloon.app/docs/Rule/port_rule/

AND,((PROTOCOL,UDP),(SRC-PORT,9000))
